      "notes": "RR 1.017 (1.016-1.019) per pack-year with a plateau at ~50 pack-years (max HR ~2.3); range capped at 50 accordingly. Current-smoker summary OR 3.14 (2.53-3.75) in the 89-study van Osch meta-analysis."
